    },
    {
      "id": "a6ebf3f9-3c96-4bba-a144-c62e21b68dc4",
      "index": 219,
      "type": "title",
      "level": "2",
      "content": "**信息安全控制点与审计发现摘要**",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "5afd2a12-5bd0-4708-8b81-490f88ff3f5e",
      "index": 220,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "同一单元格多段落：测试层次保真",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "d24639d1-2692-4381-97c6-f6affe1f5bed",
      "index": 221,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "单元格内多段落/项目符号：常见于审计发现与整改建议汇总。",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e214018e-1373-4495-99ec-851c857a1753",
      "index": 222,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "**控制域**",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "0d189ae4-11e3-4b4a-ac25-80d2b0d77bbc",
      "index": 223,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "**发现摘要（含项目符号）**",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "a0cd5227-4232-4534-858f-820e32bae8e2",
      "index": 224,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "**风险等级**",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "f5759cbd-5973-4242-93d6-0ca1d31a5fc7",
      "index": 225,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "**整改动作**",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "288c60c1-7df1-4193-9334-1e3654e2dd2d",
      "index": 226,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "身份与访问",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "0d13302d-7399-4e83-8fe3-be91a98fe6e3",
      "index": 227,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "• 管理员账号未强制MFA（抽样3/20）。\n• 部分服务账号共享使用，责任不可追溯。\n• 权限季度复核未形成闭环记录。",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "16ac77a1-ac75-4a61-aa25-c4e58e6fc4eb",
      "index": 228,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "高",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "8bb460a6-c96a-4374-b978-a0d2e6dad5ab",
      "index": 229,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "1) 全量开启MFA；2) 服务账号实名化与密钥轮换；3) 建立复核工单闭环。",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "7d92c9f8-303c-43dc-a143-12c4fd587af5",
      "index": 230,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "日志与监控",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "b93e737d-3e4b-4f3c-9339-326dc1dcd737",
      "index": 231,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "• 核心系统日志保留期不足（<90天）。\n• 告警阈值未区分环境（Prod/Stage）。",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "71653200-2eca-4cd1-96f4-24be752807fc",
      "index": 232,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "中",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "72ab259e-03ef-45b4-953e-015ac8b48ad8",
      "index": 233,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "延长保留期至180天；分环境阈值与降噪规则。",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "640e3475-ebb5-4d35-8e97-cf7671f4a166",
      "index": 234,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "漏洞管理",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "60e51b1b-b6ad-4d65-9b04-4e86add4fec7",
      "index": 235,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "• 高危漏洞修复SLA未达标。\n• 扫描覆盖率不完整（部分容器镜像缺失）。",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "56335f63-9ebc-4fd1-93f3-664e28ce4d97",
      "index": 236,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "中",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "505eda03-54e0-4a82-968a-44241fb52c58",
      "index": 237,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "统一SLA与例外审批；补齐镜像扫描与阻断策略。",
      "page_num": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "afa7c9f0-ceb1-4a76-9008-078cf2a823cf",
      "index": 238,
      "type": "title",
      "level": "3",
      "content": "**Case 10: 表格贴底 + 脚注（纯白无外框）**",
      "page_num": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "a87b1ec0-19e3-47ab-af4f-2fe577e480fa",
      "index": 239,
      "type": "title",
      "level": "2",
      "content": "**人力资源绩效指标（KPI/OKR）与评分规则**",
      "page_num": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "150407fb-41db-434e-ab6f-025217a38d7c",
      "index": 240,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "表格贴近页边界 + 脚注干扰",
      "page_num": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "1524eede-73f5-496e-88c8-64b40968dd3b",
      "index": 241,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "表格贴近页面底部，并附脚注：测试底部线条是否被裁切及脚注干扰。",
      "page_num": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "6d2c9d8d-6248-4590-9557-a08d901870ea",
      "index": 242,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "**指标**",
      "page_num": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "d54bfbb8-bd02-4565-a3c9-2153765c83e6",
      "index": 243,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "**定义**",
      "page_num": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "530ac4c8-2025-4892-81ab-9a00f37e17fd",
      "index": 244,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "**评分规则**",
      "page_num": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "d6ac8354-5039-4d83-bc36-0e1a574cc7e1",
      "index": 245,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "**权重**",
      "page_num": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "fd2ded57-8f15-4fb5-a6b4-efee623fb656",
